# 66. OPTIMIZATION ENGINE

Gunakan logika:

```text
availableForSpending =
income - savingsTarget
```

Kemudian:

```text
remainingSpendingLimit =
availableForSpending - actualExpense
```

Jika ada sisa hari:

```text
dailySpendingLimit =
remainingSpendingLimit / remainingDays
```

Jika nilai negatif:

```text
0
```

dan tampilkan warning.

Jangan membuat angka random.

